WEBVTT

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.816
And these are the things
that allow us to figure out new things.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.656
And so, I have a robot that is creative,

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:06.736
it plays piano, is a composer,

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.976
and if you listen, it plays
"Twinkle, Twinkle Little Star."

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.216
(Music)

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.496
So, all of this together,

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.640
the last thing is interaction.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:20.456
So, you have a robot,
you want it to be your playmate,

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.456
your teacher, your instructor,

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.456
you want it to interact.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.840
And isn't it so cute?

00:05:26.141 --> 00:05:27.569
(Laughter)

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.136
So, interaction is key,